# Stage and delete multiple sessions

Deletion selections survive navigation and filtering, remain separate from
persistent flags, and include hidden sessions when confirmed.

    :b jj tmux cat sh test sleep (available)
    :cp tests/fixtures/jjconfig.toml .jjconfig.toml (copied)
    :t rename-session -t 0 runner (success)
    :$ jj git init alpha (exit: 0)
    :$ jj workspace add -R alpha --name first alpha.first (exit: 0)
    :$ jj workspace add -R alpha --name second alpha.second (exit: 0)
    :t new-session -d -s alpha/first (success)
    :$ sh -c 'cd alpha.first && tmux set-option -t alpha/first @smth.repo "$(pwd -P)"' (exit: 0)
    :t set-option -t alpha/first @smth.flag 1 (success)
    :t new-session -d -s ui "smth -r 'alpha*'; cat" (success)
    :t resize-window -t ui:0 -x 120 -y 16 (success)
    :p ui:0.0
    :settle -d 2s (settled)
    :k C-p first
    :settle -d 2s -e '1/5' -e alpha/first -e C-d (settled)

Stage the live session, then filter to the repo-only session and stage that too.
The footer should count both sessions and the one hidden selection.

    :k C-d C-u second
    :settle -d 2s -e '1/5' -e alpha/second -e C-d (settled)
    :k C-d
    :snap -d 2s -e '2 sessions' -e '1 hidden'

```terminal
session: second                                                                                                        ┃
  1/5 | [C-r] repo: none                                                                                               ┃
   second                                   ~/second                                                              repo ┃
   second                                                                                                         tmux ┃
▌× alpha/second                             ~/alpha.second                                                             ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
 [C-d] unstage                                                          delete [C-y] 2 sessions (1 hidden) [C-g] cancel┃
```

Clearing the query reveals both deletion markers, including the row without the
cursor. Colour coverage verifies that both staged names remain distinguished.

    :k C-u
    :snap -d 2s -e '5/5' --color

```terminal
session:                                                                                                               ┃
  5/5 | [C-r] repo: none                                                                                               ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
▌■ ui                                                                                                                  ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                                              ┃
 × alpha/first                              ~/alpha.first                                                              ┃
   alpha                                    ~/alpha                                                                    ┃
 × alpha/second                             ~/alpha.second                                                             ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                           delete [C-y] 2 sessions [C-g] cancel┃
```

![light](delete-batch.md.snap.2.light.svg)
![dark](delete-batch.md.snap.2.dark.svg)

Toggling the second session off leaves only the hidden first session staged;
toggling it back on restores the batch.

    :k second
    :settle -d 2s -e '1/5' -e alpha/second -e C-d (settled)
    :k C-d
    :snap -d 2s -e '1 session' -e '1 hidden'

```terminal
session: second                                                                                                        ┃
  1/5 | [C-r] repo: none                                                                                               ┃
   second                                   ~/second                                                              repo ┃
   second                                                                                                         tmux ┃
▌  alpha/second                             ~/alpha.second                                                             ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
 [C-d] delete                                                            delete [C-y] 1 session (1 hidden) [C-g] cancel┃
```

