  0/5 | [C-r] repo: none                                                                                               ┃
   unmatched                                ~/unmatched                                                           repo ┃
▌  unmatched                                                                                                      tmux ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
